{"id":"P096-2","subject":"P","unit":"P096","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 1~50문항","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P096-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n\n                       \n전달함수가           인 제어시스템의 감쇠비     \n와 시스템의 상태로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① , 임계제동   ② , 부족제동\n\n③ ,  과제동    ④ , 무진동\n\n⑤ , 임계제동","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":559},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m26-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n전달함수에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 선형시불변 시스템에서만 적용가능하다.\n\n② 전달함수는 입력에 대한 출력의 라플라스 변환비로\n\n  정의한다.\n\n③ 초기조건은 0으로 한다.\n\n④ 전달함수는 임펄스 응답의 라플라스 변환과 같다.\n\n⑤ 비선형이나 시변시스템에도 적용된다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m27-q.webp","width":678,"height":636},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1422}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n\n제어시스템의 상태방정식     에서\n         일 때, 특성방정식의 근은?\n        \n\n\n① ,        ② , \n\n③ ,        ④ , \n\n⑤ , ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m28-q.webp","width":696,"height":622},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":460},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m28-e2.webp","width":696,"height":500}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n보상기를 이용하여 제어시스템의 폐루프 전달함수에 극점을\n\n추가했을때 생기는 변화로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n① 속응성이 나빠지고 정상상태 오차는 항상 커진다.\n\n② 응답이 느려지지만 정상상태 오차를 감소시킬 수 있다.\n\n③ 근궤적이 죄측으로 이동하여 시스템의 안정도가 향상된다.\n\n④ 위상여유가 증가하고 시스템의 안정도가 향상된다.\n\n⑤ 극점은 항상 원점을 지나기 때문에 정상상태 특성이 자동\n\n  으로 개선된다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1384}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n송전계통에서 △결선을 사용하는 이유는?\n\n\n① 송전선로의 리액턴스를 줄여 선로손실을 감소시키기 위\n\n  해서\n\n② 제5고조파를 직렬리액터 방식으로 억제하기 위해서\n\n③ 중성점 전위 상승과 지락전류를 억제하여 안정도를 높이\n\n  기 위해서\n\n④ 제3고조파 전류를 결선 내부에서 순환시켜 외부로 방출\n\n  되지 않도록 하기 위해서\n\n⑤ 무효전력 억제하여 송전계통의 역률을 향상시키기 위해서","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":618},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":508}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n60Hz의 3상 1회선 송전선이 통신선과 평행하게 가설되\n\n어 있다. 1선 지락으로 인해 50A의 영상전류가 흐르고,\n\n송전선과 통신선 간의 상호 인덕턴스가 0.04mHkm일\n\n때, 통신선에 작용하는 전자유도전압V은?\n\n(단, 영상전류는 전 전선에 일정하게 흐르며, 송전선과 통\n\n 신선의 병행거리는 50km이다.)\n\n\n①          ② \n\n③          ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":713}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n선간 단락 고장 발생시 선로에 나타나는 성분으로 옳은\n\n것은?\n\n\n① 정상, 역상, 영상전류가 존재하며, 중성점 잔류전압이\n\n  존재한다.\n\n② 영상, 정상전류가 존재하며, 중성점 잔류전압이 존재한다.\n\n③ 영상, 역상전류가 존재하며, 중성점 잔류전압이 존재한다.\n\n④ 정상, 역상전류가 존재하며, 영상전류는 존재하지 않는다.\n\n⑤ 역상전류가 존재하며, 영상, 정상전류는 존재하지 않는다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m32-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m32-e1.webp","width":678,"height":662}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n다음 식에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n(단, 회전체 동기각속도rads, 관성정수J,\n 기계적입력, sin전기적 출력이다.)\n\n                 sinrads\n\n\n\n① 계통고장 등 외란 발생시 평형이 깨지고 회전자가 가속\n\n  혹은 감속한다.\n② 인 경우, 회전자가 가속되고 주파수가 상승\n\n  한다.\n\n③ 전력동요는 상차각에 영향을 받는다.\n\n④ 이 클수록 계통의 안정도가 향상된다.\n\n⑤ 가 클수록 계통의 안정도가 향상된다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m33-q.webp","width":678,"height":637},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m33-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n연간발생전력이 MWh, 최대전력이 MW일 때,\n\n연간 부하율은? (단, 1년은 8760시간이다.)\n\n① ×        ② ×          \n\n                \n③                ④                     ×  ×    \n\n  \n⑤     ×  ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":577},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m34-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n그림과 같이 개 도체가 정사각형 배치를 이루고 있을 때,\n등가 선간거리m는? (단, 간격은 m, ,\n, , , 이다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n①          ② \n\n③          ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m35-q.webp","width":696,"height":853},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m35-e1.webp","width":696,"height":982}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n300kV 송전선로에서 송전거리가 200km일 때, 송전\n\n용량 계수법에 의한 송전용량은 몇 kW인가?\n\n(단, 송전용량 계수는 1000으로 한다.)\n\n\n① 150000       ② 300000\n\n③ 450000       ④ 600000\n\n⑤ 900000","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m36-q.webp","width":696,"height":453},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m36-e1.webp","width":696,"height":900}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n80kW, 지상역률 80인 부하에 60kW, 지상역률 60\n인 부하를 추가로 증설하여 사용하려 한다.\n\n이 경우, 역률 100가 되도록 하기위해 부하에 필요한\n\n진상 무효전력kVar은?\n\n\n① 80          ② 100\n\n③ 120         ④ 140\n\n⑤ 160","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m37-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m37-e1.webp","width":678,"height":907}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n10개의 가로등이 200m 거리에 동일한 간격으로 배치되\n\n어 있다. 가로등의 배선은 단상 2선식이고, 한 등에 필요한\n전류는 5A 이며, 전선의 단면적은 50mm, 도전율이\n50mΩ･mm이라면, 한쪽 끝에서 100V로 급전할 때\n\n최종 전등에 가해지는 전압은 약 몇 V인가?\n\n\n① 90          ② 92\n\n③ 94          ④ 96\n\n⑤ 98","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m38-q.webp","width":678,"height":652},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m38-e1.webp","width":678,"height":975}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\n3상 배전선로에서 송전단 전압은 500V, 역률은 0.85\n\n이고, 수전단 전압은 480V, 역률은 0.75이다.\n\n배전선로의 전체 손실은 몇 kW인가?\n\n(단, 선로에 흐르는 전류는 10A이며, 전력손실은 송전단\n\n 전력과 수전단 전력의 차이다.)\n\n①        ② \n③        ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m39","number":39},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m39-q.webp","width":678,"height":628},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m39-e1.webp","width":696,"height":739}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q15","number":15,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 40번","searchText":" 40\n\n안정도 향상을 위한 대책 중에서 계통의 리액턴스를 감소\n\n시키는 방법에 해당되지 않는 것은?\n\n\n① 복도체 방식을 채용한다.\n\n② 선로의 병행회선을 증설한다.\n\n③ 리액턴스가 적은 발전기 및 변압기를 사용한다.\n\n④ 선로에 직렬 콘덴서를 삽입한다.\n\n⑤ 속응여자방식을 채용한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m40","number":40},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m40-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m40-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1143}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q16","number":16,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 41번","searchText":" 41\n\n총 낙차가 82m, 사용수량이 25ms인 수력발전소에서\n\n                                      \n수로의 길이가 4000m, 수로의 구배가          , 수압철관의        \n손실낙차를 1m라고 할 때, 발전소의 출력은 약 몇 MW\n\n인가? (단, 수차 및 발전기의 종합효율은 80이고, 중력\n가속도는 9.8ms이다.)\n\n\n① 15          ② 15.242\n\n③ 15.484        ④ 15.680\n\n⑤ 16.072","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m41","number":41},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m41-q.webp","width":696,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m41-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q17","number":17,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 42번","searchText":" 42\n\n경간이 200m인 가공전선로의 이도가 7m이다.\n\n전선의 이도를 8m로 하기위해 추가로 필요한 전선의\n\n길이는 몇 cm인가?\n\n\n① 10          ② 15\n\n③ 20          ④ 25\n\n⑤ 30","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m42","number":42},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m42-q.webp","width":696,"height":597},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m42-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1550}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q18","number":18,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 43번","searchText":" 43\n\n비율차동 계전기에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 내부고장 시, 계전기는 차전류에 의해 동작하여 즉시\n\n  차단을 명령한다.\n\n② 외부고장 시, 계전기는 고장을 감지하지만 고장전류가\n\n  설정된 전류비율을 초과하지 않으면 차단하지 않는다.\n\n③ 계전기의 전류비율 설정값은 정정할 수 있다.\n\n④ 발전기 및 변압기의 내부고장보호에 사용되며, 주로 단\n\n  락사고 보호용으로 사용된다.\n\n⑤ 오차나 작은 전류에도 즉시 동작해야 한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m43","number":43},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m43-q.webp","width":678,"height":723},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m43-e1.webp","width":696,"height":332},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m43-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1173}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q19","number":19,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 44번","searchText":" 44\n\n세 개의 부하 , , 의 설비용량이 각각 26.5kW,\n25kW, 20kW이고, 수용률은 모두 0.8일 때, 합성\n\n최대 수요전력W은? (단, 부등률은 1.1이다.)\n\n\n① 48000        ② 50000\n\n③ 52000        ④ 54000\n\n⑤ 57200","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m44","number":44,"note":"원본 정답표에서 복원한 정답입니다."},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m44-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m44-e1.webp","width":678,"height":711}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q20","number":20,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 45번","searchText":" 45\n\n자계의 세기가 4ATm인 평등자계내의 4의 점자하\n에 작용하는 힘N 은?\n\n\n① 1           ② 4\n\n③ 8           ④ 16\n\n⑤ 20","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m45","number":45},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m45-q.webp","width":678,"height":517},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m45-e1.webp","width":696,"height":548}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q21","number":21,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 46번","searchText":" 46\n\n다음 그림과 같은 접지도체구가 있다. 접지도체구 중심으\n\n로부터 cm 떨어진 곳에 진전하 C이 있을\n\n때, 접지도체구에 유도되는 영상전하는 ′ C이\n라면 접지도체구의 반지름 m은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 0.04         ② 0.06\n\n③ 0.08         ④ 0.12\n\n⑤ 0.16","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m46","number":46},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m46-q.webp","width":696,"height":764},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m46-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1334}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q22","number":22,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 47번","searchText":" 47\n\n구좌표계 ∅에서 위치벡터의 미소변위 을 옳게\n\n나타낸 것은?\n\n① ∅∅\n② ∅sin∅\n③ ∅cos∅\n④ cos∅∅\n⑤ ∅sin∅","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m47","number":47},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m47-q.webp","width":696,"height":590},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m47-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1187}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q23","number":23,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 48번","searchText":" 48\n\n권수가 200인 단상 변압기에 60Hz의 정현파 교류를\n\n인가할 때 유기기기전력의 최댓값이 240V였다.\n\n이 변압기 권선의 최대 자속은?\n\n\n                          \n①            ②      \n                          \n③            ④      \n    \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m48","number":48},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m48-q.webp","width":696,"height":529},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m48-e1.webp","width":678,"height":695},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m48-e2.webp","width":696,"height":519}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q24","number":24,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 49번","searchText":" 49\n\n평행하게 접한 두 유전체의 경계면에 전계가 수직으로 입\n\n사할 때의 설명으로 옳은 것은?\n(단, 각 유전체의 유전율 관계는 이다.)\n\n   ㉠ 작용하는 힘은 N 이다.                           \n\n   ㉡ 경계면 양쪽의 전속밀도는 같다.\n\n   ㉢ 전계의 접선성분은 0이다.\n\n   ㉣ 전계와 전속밀도는 굴절한다.\n\n\n\n① ㉠㉡         ② ㉡㉢\n\n③ ㉢㉣         ④ ㉠㉡㉢\n\n⑤ ㉡㉢㉣","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m49","number":49},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m49-q.webp","width":678,"height":794},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m49-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1365},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m49-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1334}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P096-S2-Q25","number":25,"question":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트) · 객관식 50번","searchText":" 50\n\nC의 도체1과 C 도체2 사이에 나타나는 정전\n용량을 전위계수로 표현한 것은? (단, 이다.)\n\n\n                \n①            ② \n\n                                 \n③            ④ \n\n          \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.08.02 기술보증기금 (인크루트)","originalId":"2025p2-e16-m50","number":50},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m50-q.webp","width":678,"height":646},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m50-e1.webp","width":678,"height":550},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e16-m50-e2.webp","width":696,"height":891}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
